          "text": "The Styles gallery on the Home tab turns the current paragraph into a heading (five levels, numbered automatically), a title, an author line, an abstract or a keyword line. Each tile is drawn in the font and size the document type prints it in. Alignment (left, centre, right, justified) sits in the Paragraph group beside it.",
