      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Table on the Insert tab creates a grid you fill in directly, with a caption and a label for cross-references. While the caret is in a table, the Table Design and Table Layout tabs add rows, columns, styles and shading. Table ",
