        },
        {
          "latex": "{\\mathbf{x}}^{*}=-A^{-1}\\mathbf{b}=(1.0, -1.0{)}^{⊤}",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": ". The one-variable case of Eq. ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "(5)",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
