{
  "children": [
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Reducing build times in large-scale monorepos",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "Title"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "A. Author, Developer Productivity Team, Somewhere Software — May 2026",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "Author"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Median CI build time in our monorepo has grown from 8 to 35 minutes in 18 months, because the module count tripled while caching stayed machine-local. We analyse the causes, compare three remedies and recommend a phased rollout of a shared build cache, dependency pruning and test sharding. We project a median incremental build of 10 minutes, a 70% reduction, for about 1.5 engineer-months.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "Abstract"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Problem statement",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "A push to the main monorepo currently takes 35 minutes to build and test on average, and 52 minutes at the 95th percentile. Developer surveys rank build latency as the first source of friction ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "keys": [
            "survey2026"
          ],
          "style": "cite",
          "type": "Citation"
        },
        {
          "text": ". The problem compounds: slow builds encourage large pull requests, which are harder to review, conflict more often and build more slowly.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Table ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "label": "tab:stages",
          "kind": "ref",
          "type": "CrossRef"
        },
        {
          "text": " shows where the time goes.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "rows": [
        [
          "Stage",
          "Median (min)",
          "Share"
        ],
        [
          "Dependency resolution",
          "6",
          "17\\%"
        ],
        [
          "Compilation",
          "17",
          "49\\%"
        ],
        [
          "Tests",
          "12",
          "34\\%"
        ],
        [
          "Total",
          "35",
          "100\\%"
