      "alignment": "lrr",
      "style": "booktabs",
      "merges": [],
      "header": true,
      "repeat_header": false,
      "shading": {},
      "type": "Table"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Three factors contribute roughly equally to the regression:",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The module count grew from 120 to 380 without revisiting the dependency graph; many modules pull in transitive dependencies they never use.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The cache is local to each machine and is invalidated by environment drift (JDK patch level, locale, timezone). The CI cache hit rate is below 40%.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Test execution is poorly parallelised: the payments integration suite takes 14 minutes on a single executor.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        }
      ],
      "type": "List"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Options considered",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Option A: shared build cache",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "A content-addressed cache keys each task output on the hash of its inputs rather than on machine state. If a fraction ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "h",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " of tasks are served from the cache at a mean cost ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "\\tau",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the build time becomes",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "latex": "T(h) = (1-h)\\,T_0 + h\\,\\tau ,",
      "numbered": true,
      "label": "eq:model",
      "type": "MathBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "where ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "T_0 = 35",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " min is today’s build. With ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "h = 0.8",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " and ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "\\tau = 4",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " min, Equation ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "label": "eq:model",
          "kind": "eqref",
          "type": "CrossRef"
        },
        {
          "text": " gives about 10 minutes. A pilot on two smaller repositories raised the hit rate from 38% to 87% and cut the median build by 60%",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Four weeks of CI data, 1,240 builds in total.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "Footnote"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Option B: dependency pruning",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Static analysis found 94 unused transitive edges. Removing them shrinks the rebuild set for a typical one-module change from about 70 modules to about 25. The change is low-risk: each removal is verified by a clean build before merging.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Option C: test sharding",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Splitting the payments integration suite across four executors reduces its wall-clock time from 14 to 4.5 minutes. It requires tagging 340 test files with a shard index.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Recommendation",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "We recommend the phased plan in Table ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "label": "tab:phases",
          "kind": "ref",
          "type": "CrossRef"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Phases 1 and 2 are independent and can run in parallel; phase 3 depends on the pruned graph of phase 2.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "rows": [
        [
          "Phase",
          "Strategy",
          "Timeline",
          "Expected impact"
        ],
        [
          "1",
          "Shared cache",
          "Jun 2026",
          "−60\\% median build time"
        ],
        [
          "2",
          "Dependency pruning",
          "Jul–Aug 2026",
          "−30\\% rebuild set"
        ],
        [
          "3",
          "Test sharding",
          "Sep 2026",
          "−10 min at P95"
        ]
      ],
      "caption": "Phased rollout plan.",
      "label": "tab:phases",
      "alignment": "clll",
      "style": "booktabs",
      "merges": [],
      "header": true,
      "repeat_header": false,
      "shading": {},
      "type": "Table"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Total estimated effort is 1.5 engineer-months.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Risks and mitigations",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Cache poisoning: content-addressed keys and a nightly integrity check.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "False-positive pruning: every removal is gated on a green CI run.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Shard imbalance: monitored on a dashboard and re-balanced quarterly.",
              "marks": [],
