    {
      "level": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Conclusion",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Build latency is a solvable problem. The three strategies are complementary and, together, bring the median build back below 12 minutes. We request approval to start phase 1 in the June maintenance window.",
