    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "A push to the main monorepo currently takes 35 minutes to build and test on average, and 52 minutes at the 95th percentile. Developer surveys rank build latency as the first source of friction ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "[1]",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": ". The problem compounds: slow builds encourage large pull requests, which are harder to review, conflict more often and build more slowly.",
