      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": "sec:intro",
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Finding a material with a target combination of properties is a search problem over an enormous space of compositions and structures. Early statistical models mapped hand-built descriptors to properties ",
          "marks": [],
