        {
          "keys": [
            "okafor2019",
            "brandt2021"
          ],
          "style": "citep",
          "type": "Citation"
        },
        {
          "text": " and active-learning loops that choose the next experiment ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "keys": [
            "moreau2020"
          ],
          "style": "citep",
          "type": "Citation"
        },
        {
          "text": ". The review is restricted to inorganic crystals; molecular and polymer systems are surveyed elsewhere ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
