      "label": "sec:prediction",
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The most mature theme is supervised learning of a property from a structure. Early models used composition and elemental statistics as features ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "keys": [
            "varga2016"
