        {
          "text": " are the textbook answer, but they cannot delete a key, which a sliding window over a stream requires.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Our contributions are:",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "a fingerprint filter with two candidate buckets per key and a bounded eviction walk;",
