      ],
      "alignment": "center",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1.3 ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "A worked example",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Example. ",
          "marks": [
            "bold",
            "italic"
          ],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "A therapy dose of iodine-131 has an activity of 200 MBq. How many atoms does it contain, and what is its activity after 24 days?",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "From Table ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "1",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "\\lambda =1.00\\times 10^{-6} {\\mathrm{s}}^{-1}",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": ". The number of atoms follows from the definition of activity:",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "latex": "N=\\frac{A}{\\lambda}=\\frac{2.00\\times 10^{8} {\\mathrm{s}}^{-1}}{1.00\\times 10^{-6} {\\mathrm{s}}^{-1}}=2.0\\times 10^{14}.",
      "numbered": false,
      "label": null,
      "type": "MathBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "With a molar mass of 131 g/mol this is about 44 ng of iodine, an invisible quantity. After 24 days, nearly three half-lives, Equation ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "(2)",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
