          "text": " gives",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "latex": "A(24 \\mathrm{d})=200 \\mathrm{MBq}\\times 2^{-24/8.02}\\approx 25 \\mathrm{MBq}.",
      "numbered": false,
      "label": null,
      "type": "MathBlock"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1.4 ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Decay chains",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Often the product of a decay is itself radioactive. For a parent ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "1",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " that feeds a daughter ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "2",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the daughter population obeys ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "{\\dot{N}}_{2}=\\lambda_{1}N_{1}-\\lambda_{2}N_{2}",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": ", whose solution with ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "N_{2}(0)=0",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " is",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "latex": "N_{2}(t)=N_{1}(0) \\frac{\\lambda_{1}}{\\lambda_{2}-\\lambda_{1}}\\left(e^{-\\lambda_{1}t}-e^{-\\lambda_{2}t}\\right).",
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "MathBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "When the parent lives much longer than the daughter, the ratio of activities settles to a constant, a state called transient equilibrium:",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "latex": "\\frac{A_{2}}{A_{1}}\\rightarrow \\frac{\\lambda_{2}}{\\lambda_{2}-\\lambda_{1}}.",
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "MathBlock"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The technetium generator used in hospitals works this way. Molybdenum-99 (65.9 h) decays to technetium-99m (6.01 h). Inserting the two decay constants, ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "0.0105 {\\mathrm{h}}^{-1}",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " and ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "0.115 {\\mathrm{h}}^{-1}",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " respectively, into Equation ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "(5)",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": " gives an activity ratio of about 1.1: the daughter is always slightly more active than its parent, and can be “milked” from the generator every day.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "1.5 ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Summary",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Decay is random for one nucleus and exponential for many.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "ListItem"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The half-life is ln 2 divided by the decay constant.",
              "marks": [],
              "type": "Text"
