      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Apparatus",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "A condensate of about ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "4\\times 10^{4}",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " atoms of ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "^{87}\\mathrm{Rb}",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " is prepared in a magnetic trap and transferred to a ring-shaped dipole potential of radius 20 micrometresm. A 24-site lattice is imprinted with a digital micromirror device. The winding number is read out by releasing the atoms and imaging the central hole, whose size scales with the circulation.",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Measured lifetimes",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": null,
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "We prepare ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "latex": "w=1",
          "type": "MathInline"
        },
        {
          "text": " by a short rotation of the lattice and hold the atoms for a variable time before readout. Each lifetime below is the 1/e time of the surviving fraction, obtained from at least 40 repetitions per hold time (Table ",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        },
        {
          "label": "tab:life",
          "kind": "ref",
          "type": "CrossRef"
        },
        {
          "text": ").",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "alignment": "justify",
      "type": "Paragraph"
    },
    {
      "rows": [
        [
          "Depth V0 (Er)",
          "J/h (Hz)",
          "Barrier (nK)",
