        {
          "text": "Conclusion",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "numbered": true,
      "label": "ch:concl",
      "type": "Section"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "A simple blending law, limited by torque and slip, adds 9 km of range to a light electric vehicle without changing the braking distance noticeably. The next step is a road test on the prototype, with the battery temperature included in the charge limit.",
          "marks": [],
