        },
        {
          "text": " lists the fitted Ti 2p₃/₂ parameters. The Ti⁴⁺ position is stable to within 0.07 eV across the series, confirming that charge referencing is not responsible for the apparent new component. The Ti³⁺ peak sits 1.7 eV below Ti⁴⁺ throughout. If every Ti³⁺ ion is charge-compensated by half an oxygen vacancy, a Ti³⁺ fraction ",
