        {
          "text": "SOLAR-CAT: Defect-engineered photocatalysts for solar hydrogen",
          "marks": [],
          "type": "Text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "Title"
    },
    {
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Principal Investigator: Q. Principal · Co-Investigators: R. Coinvest, S. Partner",
